[{"id": 39768251, "text": "Brackets can be used for lots of things, but one special purpose is to put in a definition (explaining what a difficult word means). There is an example in that first sentence! Here is another example:\n<br><br>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35613018, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 39768303, "text": "The narcissus (daffodil) is very beautiful.", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 32, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35613018, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p><span style=\"font-size:32px;font-family:SassoonInfantRg-Regular;\">The narcissus (daffodil) is very beautiful.</span></p>", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 35613034, "text": "Can you see how the word inside the brackets explains what the word before means? This can be particularly important when writing about something that includes specialist vocabulary – words that not everyone might know the meaning of. \n<br><br>\n<h2>The activity:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Think about a topic you are interested in but that not everyone knows about, e.g. Minecraft, bikes, a craft you enjoy, looking after a pet, etc.</li>\n<li>Write a sentence which includes a specialist word that not everyone will know. In the example sentence this was ‘narcissus’.</li>\n<li>In your sentence, put a short explanation in brackets after the tricky word so that people will understand what it means. It is usually best if the explanation is a single word, like ‘daffodil’ in the example, but sometimes you will need to use a few more, like in the first sentence on this page.</li>\n<li>Write two more sentences in the same way so you have three sentences all together.</li>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": "1633531391689_1image1-01FHB0XKG1QKBWPWCJHDW1AMAB.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 35613018, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]